        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Charge Rate Per Cubic Foot. The following consumption rate schedule is adopted to encourage water conservation and promote environmental quality. </span></li>
        	</ol>
