        <p style="margin-left:80px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Inside the City limits, for each one hundred cubic feet, or major fraction (approximately seven hundred fifty gallons) of water used, there will be the following consumption charges:</span></p>
        
