        </table>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">For outside the City of Spokane metered and unmetered connection on the City&rsquo;s water mains supplying hydrants, standpipes, or automatic sprinklers for private fire protection to the premises, charges will be made in accord with the following:</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol style="margin-left:40px">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Size of Connection / Service Charge per Month.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:37.9pt">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Size of Service</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Meter Charge Per Month</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">&nbsp;</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2026</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3 inch or smaller</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$35.62</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">4 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$50.28</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">6 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$69.88</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">8 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$84.54</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:114.2pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:132.6pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$101.12</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        	</tbody>
        </table>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, December 8, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, January 18, 2026</p><p>ORD C36777 Section 6</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=13.04.2012">Section 13.04.2012</a> Outside City Residence Rates and Charges<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Basic Charge: Single-family Residence.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Outside the City, for each single-family residence, the monthly service charge where the water is used or reflected in the records of the City of Spokane utilities billings office shall be:</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:38.3pt">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:69.0pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2026</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:69.0pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$30.11</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        	</tbody>
        </table>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol start="2">
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Unless otherwise provided, for two or more single-family residences on one meter, they will be addressed under multifamily.</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Consumption.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">The following rate schedule is adopted to encourage water conservation and promote environmental quality. Outside the City limits, for each one hundred cubic feet or major fraction (approximately seven hundred fifty gallons) of water used, there will be the following consumption rates:</span></p>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:20.7pt">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Monthly Water Usage</span></span></p>
        
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">(in cubic feet)</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Rate</span></span></p>
        
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Per Hundred Cubic Feet</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">&nbsp;</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2026</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Zero up to 600</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$0.5663</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Greater than 600 up to 1,200</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$1.1983</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Greater than 1,200 up to 2,500</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$1.6119</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Greater than 2,500 up to 4,500</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$2.5483</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:129.75pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Greater than 4,500</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; width:119.3pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$3.6656</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        	</tbody>
        </table>
        
        <ol start="3" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">No vacancy allowance.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="4" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Family daycare homes shall be billed at the single-family rate. For purposes of this provision, &quot;family daycare homes&quot; shall mean a day care facility:</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">furnishing care, supervision, and guidance for persons twelve years of age or younger for more than four but less than twenty-four hours in a day;</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol start="2">
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">licensed as such by the Washington State Department of Social and Health Services; and</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol start="3">
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">which regularly provides such care during part of a twenty-four hour day for no more than twelve children in the dwelling of the person(s) in charge.</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="5" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Capital Charge.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">In addition to the basic charge and consumption charge, there shall be a capital charge for all accounts as established and provided for in&nbsp;SMC 13.035.500.</span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, December 8, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, January 18, 2026</p><p>ORD C36777 Section 7</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=13.04.2014">Section 13.04.2014</a> Outside City Rate to Other Purveyors<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">The rate to other purveyors for standby and/or emergency water service and use outside the City&rsquo;s service area shall be at the following rate per one hundred cubic feet of water used plus outside City commercial monthly service rate, unless modified by separate agreement:</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:20.75pt">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:69.0pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2026</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:69.0pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$1.5694</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        	</tbody>
        </table>
        
        <ol>
        	<li style="list-style-type:none">
        	<ol>
        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Operations and Maintenance Capital Charge for Standby and/or Emergency Water Service.</span></li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:80px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">In addition to the standby/emergency water charge, there shall be charged a capital charge for all accounts as established and provided for in SMC 13.035.500 - Water Service Only Commercial User &ndash; Minimum Capital Charge &ndash; Outside City (includes first twenty-eight units) and Water Service Only Commercial User &ndash; Outside City &ndash; capital consumption charges. For continuous users, they shall be charged a capital charge for all accounts as established and provided for in SMC 13.035.500 - Water Service Only Other purveyor- continuous supplemental water user-outside-capital consumption charge (Per hundred cubic feet).</span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, December 8, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, January 18, 2026</p><p>ORD C36777 Section 8</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=13.04.2015">Section 13.04.2015</a> Outside City Planned Unit Developments (PUD)<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Basic Charge.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">In general, a planned unit development (PUD) designation is one approved in accord with applicable PUD development standards and served by a master water meter. However, if a dwelling unit would otherwise be included within a PUD designation but has its own individual city water meter, it will be billed as a single-family residence under SMC 13.04.2012 or other applicable rate section. Questions of applicability are determined by the director. [Cross Reference: <a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Section=17A.020.160">SMC 17A.020.160</a>(T)]</span></p>
        
        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Consumption.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">For billing water consumption, the outside city PUD basic charge will be charged the same as a single-family residence outside the City limits except the PUD&rsquo;s total consumption will be divided by the total number of dwelling units to determine the per-dwelling consumption for purposes of applying the rate steps defined in SMC 13.04.2012(B).</span></p>
        
        <ol start="3" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">Size of Service / Meter Charge Per Month.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:19.8pt; width:3.2in">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Size of Service</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Meter Charge Per Month</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">&nbsp;</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2026</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">1 inch or smaller</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$43.45</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">1 &frac12; inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$64.68 </span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">2 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$87.59</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$134.38</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">4 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$181.39</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">6 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$252.52</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">8 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">$507.26</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="background-color:white; height:.2in; width:112.95pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10 inch</span></span></p>
        			</td>
