        <p style="margin-left:40px; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">In addition to the basic charge and consumption charge, there shall be charged a capital charge for all accounts as established and provided for in&nbsp;SMC 13.035.500.</span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 24, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, January 7, 2026</p><p>ORD C36811 Section 8</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=13.04.2016">Section 13.04.2016</a> Outside City Commercial and Industrial Rates<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
