        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 24, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, January 7, 2026</p><p>ORD C36811 Section 9</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=13.04.20161">Section 13.04.20161</a> PDA Water Rates<br />
